# The register of the people whose identities appear in the revision history,
# one manifest per person. The .mailmap and AUTHORS files are generated from
# it, so a change to how someone is identified or credited is made here and
# both files are then regenerated with the mailmap and authors tools.
#
# The name and email values are the preferred identity. Each alias value is
# another identity of the same person in the history, written as
# 'Name <email>' or '<email>'. The authors value says how AUTHORS lists the
# person: name (the default), email (name and email), or none (left out,
# which is how bots are excluded).
#
: 1
name: William Roy
email: wroy@proton.me
authors: name
